# Local only. This repository is public, and these are not ours to publish: the listing photos belong to the
# photographer, and the plan sketches, 1993 drawings, map and sales prospectus are the house's paperwork.
# Keep a backup of them somewhere else. match.json is our own work, so it is tracked.
/source/*
!/source/photos/
/source/photos/*
!/source/photos/match.json
*.pdf

# Regenerated by the build
/.venv/
/build/
/out/
